  "releaseNotes": "0.0.3-alpha (2026-11-18) - No node changed. The package page: a short README in the shape\n      vvvv libraries use, one sentence of description, authors and owners \"red\", and the LICENSE\n      and the third-party notices inside the package.\n\n      0.0.2-alpha (2026-11-08) - BREAKING: Read GeoJSON and Write GeoJSON are\n      now FromGeoJSON and ToGeoJSON, in the same category, with no alias - named after what you\n      get, as VL.NetTopologySuite 0.0.6-alpha renamed Read WKT and Write WKT to FromWKT and ToWKT.\n      A patch made with an older version shows the old node unresolved; put the new one in its\n      place. GeoJSONReader (Reactive) keeps its name: it reads a file, which is what Reader means\n      in VL. Requires VL.NetTopologySuite 0.0.6-alpha.\n\n      0.0.1-alpha - First release. Read GeoJSON, GeoJSONReader (Reactive) - a file read and\n      parsed in the background - and Write GeoJSON, in NetTopologySuite.IO.\n      Developed as VL.GeoJSON until 2026-10-18. Requires VL.NetTopologySuite 0.0.4-alpha, which\n      opens the features (Split, GetAttribute) and is installed with this package.",
